# Test your FastAPI endpoints

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hello/User
Accept: application/json

###

# 非流式对话：只发本轮输入，历史由服务端按 thread_id 维护
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "现在几点了？",
  "thread_id": "test_thread_1",
  "user_id": "test_user_1"
}

###

# 流式对话（SSE）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "现在几点了？",
  "thread_id": "test_thread_1",
  "user_id": "test_user_1"
}

###

# 查询历史
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/messages?thread_id=test_thread_1
Accept: application/json

###
